BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventseasonalcocktailtouronthedouble26176-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261113T173759Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
SUMMARY:Seasonal Cocktail Tour on the Double
DESCRIPTION:Spend an afternoon discovering seasonal cocktails\, local flavors and a little bit of Frederick from the top deck of a vintage London bus. We’ll set off from RAK Brewing Co. for a jaunt around town\, mixing local history and trivia with three stops along the way for something considerably more refreshing. Our featured partners are True Standard Distilling\, Spacie Gracie and RAK Brewing Co.\, with each creating a featured seasonal cocktail for the tour. Prefer yours without the alcohol? Mocktail options will be available too\, so everyone can enjoy the experience. It’s three hours of cocktails\, Frederick\, good company and double-decker sightseeing\, all wrapped into one rather lovely afternoon out. Grab a friend\, find a seat upstairs and discover what Frederick is serving this season. Tour Highlights: Visit three Frederick locations\, featuring True Standard Distilling\, Spacie Gracie and RAK Brewing Co. Enjoy the opportunity to try a featured seasonal cocktail or mocktail at each stop. Explore Frederick aboard our vintage London double-decker with local history and trivia along the way. Enjoy a relaxed\, social afternoon designed for discovering something new with friends. What’s Included: Stops at True Standard Distilling\, Spacie Gracie and RAK Brewing Co. An opportunity to enjoy a featured seasonal cocktail or mocktail at each location Three hours aboard our iconic vintage double-decker and at our partner locations Local history\, trivia and sightseeing between stops A relaxed afternoon exploring some of Frederick’s local drinks scene TICKETING DETAILS: DURATION: 3 hours DEPARTS FROM: RAK Brewing Co.\, Frederick\, Maryland at 1pm Your ticket includes your three-hour double-decker tour through Frederick\, with visits to True Standard Distilling\, Spacie Gracie and RAK Brewing Co. Featured seasonal cocktails and mocktails will be available at each stop. Guests must be 21 or older to consume alcoholic beverages. A valid government-issued photo ID will be required. Mocktail options are available for guests who prefer not to drink alcohol.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/seasonal-cocktail-tour-on-the-double/26176/
END:VEVENT
