SUMMARY:Gyro & Pastry Days
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for TEN delicious days of Greek flavor\, Frederick! Join us for Gyro & Pastry Days — a weeklong celebration of your favorite Greek eats and treats! Savor mouthwatering gyros Enjoy juicy chicken souvlaki Cool down with a fresh Greek salad Indulge in a variety of authentic Greek pastries like baklava\, koulourakia\, and more! When: November 12-20 | 11 AM – 8 PM\, Last Saturday November 21 | 11AM - 6PM Whether you're stopping by for lunch\, picking up dinner\, or satisfying your sweet tooth — Gyro & Pastry Days is your chance to enjoy the flavors of Greece right here in Frederick. Mark your calendars\, bring your appetite\, and we’ll see you soon!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/gyro-%26-pastry-days/14500/
